<decision #track.fix-workflow-fulfill-terminal-and-continuation.failure-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NKB7QAYQVWAJAKGQDKA2>
  Provider failure 之前已有 partial assistant content 时谁拥有终态？
  </?01M1B0NKB7QAYQVWAJAKGQDKA2>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE99>
    当前 provider failure 必须覆盖旧 partial content。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE99>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9A>
    Provider terminal failure SHALL fail the actor; prior Conversation Domain output MAY be retained as evidence but MUST NOT reclassify the terminal state。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9A>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9B>
    effect terminal 是当前控制事实，历史消息只是记录。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9B>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9C>
    真实回归 sequence 68/170。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9C>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.fix-workflow-fulfill-terminal-and-continuation.sync-wait-single-writer apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9D>
  同步 delegate tool result 由谁写入？
  </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9D>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9E>
    只有 childDone terminal message。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9E>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9F>
    The WAIT_FOR_CHILD_DONE control return SHALL NOT commit a tool result; childDone SHALL be the sole writer of the paired success/failure tool result。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9F>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9G>
    避免空 initial result 与 terminal result 竞争。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9G>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9H>
    真实 conversation history 的空 ToolResult。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9H>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.fix-workflow-fulfill-terminal-and-continuation.context-projection apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9J>
  Fresh workflow actor 如何理解多轮确认？
  </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9J>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9K>
    注入 parent Conversation Domain 的结构化业务历史投影，不做关键词解释。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9K>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9M>
    WorkflowFulfill SHALL project bounded prior user/assistant conversation by role and order; explicit authorization remains solely in current structured input。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9M>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9N>
    补齐上下文同时保持模型语义 authority 与授权边界。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9N>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9P>
    重试 actor 将趋势研究误解为 approval prebuilt。
    </?01M1B0NKB9VKC1GDF9V8G8TE9P>
  )>
)>
